# Pairs with UnlinkedVictimHasMarker. A crash after the predecessor update loses the only cleanup obligation.
MODULE: UnlinkWithoutMarker
TARGET: UnlinkedVictimHasMarker
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the predecessor unlinks the victim without durable recovery evidence
PERTURBS: UnlinkAndRecord

--- FIND
    /\ pending' = "victim"
--- REPLACE
    /\ pending' = "none"
--- END
